# Original Aurum route text; existing required Lakeshire trip expanded with
# verified low-level outdoor objectives, replacing anonymous pre-18 grinding.

step Road to Lakeshire
  tip From Sentinel Hill, follow the roads through Elwynn and Eastvale to Three Corners. Avoid cutting through Duskwood. Collect Parker's report at the road junction, then speak to Feldon at the bridge and learn the flight path.
  accept 244 lvl 11
  turnin 244
  accept 246 lvl 11
  accept 98407 lvl 11
  getfp "Lakeshire" npc 931

step Lakeshire inn, then town pickups
  tip Finish Wiley's report upstairs, then take Darcy's lunch downstairs. Leave the inn for the remaining town pickups.
  turnin 65
  accept 132
  accept 129 lvl 12 -- Darcy downstairs gives Parker's lunch.
  accept 118 lvl 14 -- Deliver Verner's letter before clearing the bridge-material gnolls.
  accept 125 lvl 15
  accept 98386 lvl 15 -- Take both quests from Foreman Oslow during this visit.
  accept 3741 lvl 12 -- Shawn on the dock; collect Hilarys necklace during the toolbox swim.
  vendor 956 -- Dorin Songblade at the central Lakeshire smithy; sell and repair during the existing town visit.

step Goldshire: unlock the gnoll assignment
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Follow the road west to Goldshire and deliver Verner's letter to Smith Argus. Take the horseshoes back to Lakeshire before farming the northern gnolls, so their kills count for both Verner and the bridge materials.
  turnin 118
  accept 119 lvl 13

step Lakeshire: horseshoes and the lake toolbox
  zone Redridge Mountains
  turnin 119
  accept 124 lvl 15
  tip Swim to the sunken chest east of the bridge and recover Oslow's toolbox, then return to him before collecting bridge materials. Use Aquatic Form for the swim if learned; surface for air when needed.
  collect 1309 quest 125
  collect 10958 quest 3741
  turnin 3741
  turnin 125
  accept 89 lvl 15

step Gnolls: kill credit and bridge materials
  turnin 129 -- Parker patrols the road toward Duskwood; use his name to locate the patrol.
  accept 130 lvl 12
  tip Clear Mongrels, Poachers and Thrashers around Three Corners for Feldon. Then move north of Lakeshire for Brutes and Mystics: gather the bridge fittings while completing Verner's kill counts. Continue only until both the kill counters and bridge materials are complete. Pull from the edges of camps and stay out of the Blackrock cave.
  kill 423 quest 246.1
