step Alther's Mill: spiders and eggs
  tip Follow the northern lake road to Alther's Mill. The Greater Tarantulas here are level 19-20. Kill 12 Greater Tarantulas and destroy 6 Tarantula Eggs around the mill before returning to Lakeshire. Pull one spider at a time and heal between pulls. Do not enter the northern Blackrock cave or the eastern elite keep.
  kill 505 quest 98386.1
  # The private builder resolves this client-verified missing objective as its own live egg counter.
  complete 98386 @48.20,38.00 live -- Destroy all 6 Tarantula Eggs at the mill before leaving.

step Lakeshire: finish the preparation quests
  tip Return west along the lake road and hand in the mill task before taking Wiley's report to Sentinel Hill. The group dungeon remains the next chapter.
  complete 98386 @48.20,38.00 live -- Finish any remaining Tarantula Eggs at the mill before returning to Oslow.
  turnin 98386
  vendor 956 -- Dorin Songblade at the central Lakeshire smithy; sell and repair during the existing town visit.
  level 18 -- Readiness check after authored outdoor XP, not a promised number of dungeon repeats.
